# data/serving/*.parquet  <-- committed by the pipeline (see ADR-0002)

# Logs (kept directory, ignore content)
# EXCEPTION: commit the DQ quarantine log per ADR-0006 — it is part of the
# case study deliverable (audit trail visible to reviewers without running
# the pipeline). Other ad-hoc logs remain ignored.
logs/*.log
!logs/dq_quarantine.log
logs/*.json
